  requireLineOfSight: 0
  losMask:
    serializedVersion: 2
    m_Bits: 4294967295
  lines:
  - Greetings, one who seeks freedom. I will now exposite at you.
  - 'Movement: [P1 - WASD - Space] [P2 - Arrows - CRTL] '
  - 'Combat: [P1 - E] [P2 - Right Shift]'
  - 'Shop/Inv: There exists items you can pick up throught the level and store in
    your inv. '
  - 'The inv is shared by both players. Using/Dropping items is bound to right/left
    clicking on the item. '
  - 'At the end of this stage, there is a shop you may interact with to buy/sell
    items. '
  - 'At the end of this stage, there is a shop you may interact with to buy/sell
    items (G to interact). '
  - 'NPCS: There are two NPCs you''ll encounter. One melee, the other range. '
  - These enemies are supernatural and are thus not bound by walkable spaces.
  - 'Both enemies will aggro after you enter their spheres of detection. '
  - The ranged enemy's projectiles linger in the world and will continue to do damaged
    if interacted with.
  - 'That is all you need to know! Now go, reach the gate and leave this place. '
  faceRotateSpeed: 10
  modelYawOffset: 0
  logState: 1
  drawGizmo: 1
